BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Eskenazi Museum of Art
DTSTART:20261203T223000Z
DTEND:20261203T233000Z
LOCATION:Sidney and Lois Eskenazi Museum of Art
SUMMARY:Wellness Walk
DESCRIPTION:This guided wellness walk explores 3 to 4 galleries. We offer
  a series of prompts and activities centered around using the museum for 
 wellness: finding comfort\, noticing by slowing down\, encouraging flexib
 ility and curiosity\, and reflection. Participants can spend time indepen
 dently with artworks\, with optional opportunities to share reflections a
 nd insights along the way. No art experience required\, just a willingnes
 s to pause\, notice\, and explore.About Your Guide  Leanne Anirudhan (she
 /her) is a third year undergraduate student majoring in Social Work with 
 a minor in Counseling. Her passion for art and music was fostered by a hi
 gh school ceramics teacher who regularly brought students to the Eskenazi
  Museum of Art. Outside of touring\, she loves hiking with her dog\, and 
 playing guitar. &#160\;Know Before You GoWalk-ins are welcome if there's 
 space. To reserve a space\, RSVP below.Plan to arrive at least 5 minutes 
 beforehand to check in and get ready.A small handbag may be carried at yo
 ur side. Larger bags and backpacks must be stored before touring. Free lo
 ckers are available.Where to find us\, where to park\, accessibility\, an
 d museum guidelinesWhen You ArriveCheck in with Guest Services staff on t
 he first floor.Photography is welcome\, without flash or selfie stick.Ple
 ase do not touch artwork.
