 unded. We'll cover:</p><ul style="font-weight: 400\;"><li><strong>Decodin
 g Public Funding:</strong> How city\, state\, and federal arts funders wo
 rk—and how to find opportunities built for emerging artists and organiz
 ers.  </li><li><strong>Making Data Your Superpower:</strong> How to gathe
