 rk\, accessibility\, and museum guidelines</span></a><span data-contrast=
 "none">.</span></li></ul><h3><strong>About Your Facilitator</strong></h3>
 <p>  Dedaimia Whitney earned an MFA in fiction from Indiana University un
 der the direction of Scott Russell Sanders. She taught creative writing a
 t Franklin College for many years. She has served the museum as a docent 
 since 2019. Her favorite works of art are those that are both visually st
 imulating and thought-provoking.</p>
