LOCATION:SIDNEY AND LOIS ESKENAZI MUSEUM OF ART
SUMMARY:Guided Tour
DESCRIPTION:Whether it's your first visit or your hundredth\, you'll be i
 nvited to look closely\, share ideas\, and enjoy conversation with fellow
  guests. Each tour is a little different\, featuring a unique selection o
 f artworks and perspectives.  Tours begin at the Welcome Desk on the firs
 t floor and last approximately 60 minutes. Please arrive on time\, as tou
 rs start promptly.  This small-group experience is led by Community Guide
 s who are passionate about sharing their love of art and helping guests m
 ake meaningful connections with the museum's collections.  Interested in 
 a private guided experience for an adult group or a school or youth group
 ? Check out our menu of guided experiences. (https://artmuseum.indiana.ed
 u/visit/museum-tours/index.html)  &#160\;  Know Before You GoSpace is ava
 ilable for the first 12 people to check in with Guest Services on the day
 . Drop by the information desk on the first floor of the museum when you 
 arrive.A small handbag may be carried at your side. Backpacks and large b
 ags will need to be stored before touring. Learn more aboutmuseum guideli
 nes.If you park in the IMU parking lot\, Guest Services can validate your
  parking voucher for a discount.Read aboutwhere to find us and where to p
 ark\,
